                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for jianyu &amp;lt;yujian@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/767a0590-688b-450d-9678-890811d62d10" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/767a0590-688b-450d-9678-890811d62d10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_23b failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
