                            <comment id="444692" author="simmonsja" created="Sun, 16 Feb 2025 16:34:04 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Patch &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/57871" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/57871&lt;/a&gt; fixed the ost-pool failure. My debug patch really belongs to &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18652" title="conf-sanity test_32b: FAIL: verify quota failed" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18652"&gt;LU-18652&lt;/a&gt;. The links to this ticket can be founded with labels = zfs-2.2.7&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
